version: 2.0.0
description: |
  Regression tests for @a-company/university. First tests/ dir added in
  v5.39.0 as the v6.0 PLSAT-migration safety harness. The plsat-migration
  test is LOAD-BEARING per spec §2.5 — it gates whether the v6.0
  `--delete-sources` flag may safely remove the legacy
  src/content/{courses,plsat}/*.json files.
components:
  plsat-migration-tests:
    description: |
      Byte-normalized regression harness for the PLSAT migration. For each
      of 8 PARA courses + 2 PLSAT exam versions, asserts that the migrated
      pack-layout content (notes/, quizzes/, paths/) preserves question
      counts, answer keys, explanation text (whitespace-normalized),
      pass thresholds, time limits, and totalSlots. Also includes a smoke
      test that the package pack.yaml parses and (7.11.0, server retired) that
      university-core's loadPackIndex sees the stable 12-path set.
    type: test
    anchors:
      - plsat-migration.test.ts:1-500
    tags:
      - test
      - regression
      - university
      - plsat
      - migration
      - load-bearing
